        "answer": {
          "short": "$y'=-\\dfrac{15}{(5x+4)^4}$, $y''=\\dfrac{300}{(5x+4)^5}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=(5x+4)^{-3}\\\\y'&=-3(5x+4)^{-4}(5)\\\\y'&=-15(5x+4)^{-4}\\\\y''&=(-15)(-4)(5x+4)^{-5}(5)\\\\y''&=\\frac{300}{(5x+4)^5}\\end{align*}$$",
