          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=x^{1/2}\\\\y'&=\\tfrac12x^{-1/2}\\\\y''&=-\\tfrac14x^{-3/2}\\\\y''&=-\\frac{1}{4x\\sqrt{x}}\\end{align*}$$",
