          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=x^{3/2}\\\\y'&=\\tfrac32x^{1/2}\\\\y''&=\\tfrac34x^{-1/2}\\\\y''&=\\frac{3}{4\\sqrt{x}}\\end{align*}$$",
