          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=(1-4x)^{1/2}\\\\y'&=\\tfrac12(1-4x)^{-1/2}(-4)\\\\y'&=-2(1-4x)^{-1/2}\\\\y''&=(-2)(-\\tfrac12)(1-4x)^{-3/2}(-4)\\\\y''&=-\\frac{4}{(1-4x)^{3/2}}\\end{align*}$$",
